WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Split the terminal with Command-D. Both panes appear under the current session in the sidebar.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.200
Float the second pane above the grid using its header control.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.800
Drag the floating pane by its header.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.700
Minimize the pane. It becomes a capsule at the lower right.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.450
Click the capsule to restore the floating pane.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.400
Return the pane to the grid. Its terminal output is still there.
